{
  "id": "1TI.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "1TI",
  "reference": "1 Timoteo 4",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 16,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1TI 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Koneti putintön",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwoghöy Mïkulögh nyoman lö pïstoy pikö walaka kighanatengwa osis cho pkonöy, akï terchï mïkulïs cho le lïsï akïrïp kinetut pö oy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinetut cho lata choni chay ipsötoy pich cho le lïsï, cho kimeytoy choghïntinekwa kïlentöy chi kikïpela karïn nyo nöghöy lakat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netöy pïchoni lö, merokonye kekensyö amerokonye kyam omisyewut walaka. Kigh Tororöt omisyewutchoni kwam pich cho kikughan kunkïtï man otini kakumuchö kuyokyï nyinte sörö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Karam kïgh anka tïkwïl nyo kigh Tororöt, möminye kïgh nyonikïny nyo kïtöghöy. Kïlenyona mïchini ketach kïgh anka tïkwïl akesagh keyokyï Tororöt sörö, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ompöwölo ighöy ngölyonto Tororöt nko saghat tïkuchoni kïlïkwï cho chömunote ompö tawu Tororöt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mötworinto Kristo* Yeso nyo karam",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato inetanyi tupchenicho kinetutchï, ilïkunenyi mötworinto Kristo Yeso nyo karam, otini ipöghonyi kegh ngala kighanat nko kinetut pö man cho irïpenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïrenö kegh ngal cho mönömöcha kegh nko ara Tororöt nko cho pö sölwontön. Kilö kegh aimöngisyö ompö kiwaghata Tororöt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tïngeto kikilöto por kinyiwutyenyi, wölo tïng kikilöto mïkulögh kinyiwut nyo wow tya ompö or anka tïkwïl, ompöwölo tïng kiyomisöto söpon nyo pö ye nko söpon nyo tökungwïnöy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pö man ngölyontonï akïmïchini kecham nyoman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinoghyonecha ompö pöghisyö anka tïkwïl nyoman ompöwölo kiketönöcha kikönötenyo wölo mi Tororöt nyo söpöy akï nyo le Ghetinto pich lapay, kï mïr tya pich cho kikughan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwochinö chane ngalechï ainet kinetutchï. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mekany kïsasïn chi ompöwölo techinyi chumwak, wölo ilïkwï körkeyïn nyo karam ompö pich cho kikughan ompö ngalanatengu nko otöptöngu nko chomnyogh nko kighanat nko möngot nyo pö tïlilyö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inoghyö nyoman isomönchï aiyomchï ainet pich Kikirut ntökïtenö atwan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mepïstö pöghisyeghenö ropöwontengu nyo kinyorunyi atanya kingalan werkoy akukanaghinyi poyi kanisa morïn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilchinö kegh ngalechï lasiny airötï kegh nyoman atökumï pich kïsïwa kiletatengu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Irip kegh airip kinetatengu ailet tagh igh tïkuchoni. Ompöwölo ato ighanyi lenyoni, isörunenyi kegh nko pich cho lïmöy ngaleku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
